# Locke Cole: "Whenever Locke Cole deals combat damage to a player, draw a card, then discard a card", with deathtouch and lifelink.
# Cast on turn 1 with three Moxen. On turn 3 he attacks into an empty board: Bot2 takes 2 (18), lifelink gains Bot1 2 (22), and the
# trigger draws the Mountain, then discards the Plains chosen: the drawn card is in hand when chosen.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Locke Cole
Plains
Swamp
Island
Mountain
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Locke Cole.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Locke Cole > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.CombatDamage]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Plains)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
Bot1.Graveyard = Plains
